OL,3,GNEWSAVeteran cricket commentator
OL,4,Aretires after 31 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA retiring commentator said he had been
OL,7,F"exceptionally lucky" to cover Essex
OL,8,FCounty Cricket Club's matches for 31
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FBBC Essex stalwart Dick Davies narrated
OL,12,Fthe Eagles's County Championship
OL,13,Fvictory in 2017 and saw greats such as
OL,14,FSir Alastair Cook and Graham Napier
OL,15,Fgrace the pitch.
OL,17,FHe also declined the chance to
OL,18,Finterview popstar Kylie Minogue in
OL,19,F2001, choosing instead to play a round
OL,20,Fof golf.
